WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.660
Nobody had ever flown on another planet.

2
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:18.840
The air on Mars is so thin that my blades had to spin about 2,500 times a minute. I was meant to fly five times. I flew 72.

3
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:29.020
On my last flight a rotor blade was damaged, so now I stand still in the sand, a little weather station that remembers being a pilot.

4
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:34.520
Planned for five flights. I flew seventy-two.
